  m_functionName: 
  m_description: 'Generates color masks based on vertex color channels.



    This function reads the mesh vertex color, applies intensity-based contrast

    adjustment, and allows independent masking and blending of the R, G, B, and A

    channels using custom color masks.



    Each vertex color channel can be selectively enabled, disabled, or remapped,

    making it suitable for complex material control driven by vertex painting.



    Outputs the combined RGBA result as well as individual channel values.'
